d soul into making something good, and whatever happens, I'm really proud of what I've accomplished! I've also hidden lots of surprises and little secrets throughout the demo. I hope you'll enjoy discovering them and manage to find th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T19:12:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706696495","verified_at":"2026-10-21T08:52:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4940270-1845383656391814","game_id":"steam-4940270","kind":"announcement","title":"CRAMPED Demo Coming October 19th + Join Our Discord!","summary":"Hey everyone!The CRAMPED demo is coming October 19th, as part of Steam Next Fest!The demo will offer around 25–30 minutes of gameplay. I've been working hard on it, adding a few surprises and polishing the experience before letting you loose in this oppressive concrete world.We're also working on a major sound design overhaul to make the demo feel even better. There's still work to do, but we're excited to share CRAMPED with you!JOIN THE CRAMPED DISCORDI've also opened an official Discord server","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-04T18:46:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656391814","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:10:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4940270":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:36:08Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:36:08Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4940270":"2026-10-26T15:36:08Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4940270":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:36:08Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T15:36:08Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:36:08Z"},"5290090":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15: